---
import { siteFaq } from "../data/site-faq";
---
<section class="collection-guide" aria-labelledby="collection-guide-title">
  <h2 id="collection-guide-title">Custom emojis, from your sheet to Slack</h2>
  <p>Browse the collection above, search for a reaction, or explore by theme and color. Select the stickers you want, then choose an export from your sheet.</p>
  <div class="collection-answers">
    {siteFaq.map(({ question, answer }) => <details><summary>{question}</summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}
  </div>
  <p>Already have a collection in Slack? <a href="/slack-backup">Back up your workspace’s custom emojis</a> as ZIP files with aliases and metadata.</p>
</section>
